OL,3,GNEWSANo shoot-to-kill missions against
OL,4,AIRA, says former SAS officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former officer with the Army's
OL,7,FSpecial Air Service (SAS) has denied it
OL,8,Fwas involved in shoot-to-kill missions
OL,9,Fagainst the IRA during the Troubles in
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FGeorge Simm had remained silent about
OL,13,Fhis time in Northern Ireland for almost
OL,14,F50 years, but has now accused the
OL,15,Fgovernment of abandoning veterans in
OL,16,Fits legislation to deal with the legacy
OL,17,Fof the conflict.
OL,19,FHe served during the 1970s and 80s and
OL,20,Fwas involved in hundreds of operations,
OL,21,Fincluding an SAS ambush in which three
OL,22,FIRA men were killed.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
